    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "血常规指标及CRP在鉴别诊断细菌性与病毒性上呼吸道感染中的应用分析",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "CENTER (1)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 16.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": null,
      "font_size_pt": null,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "【摘要】目的  探究血常规指标联合C反应蛋白（CRP）在细菌性与病毒性上呼吸道感染鉴别诊断中的临床应用价值。方法  选取2024年5月2025年8月我院收治的例上呼吸道感染患者为研究对象，所有患者均完善血常规及CRP检测，结合临床最终诊断结",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "【关键词】上呼吸道感染；细菌性；病毒性；血常规；C反应蛋白；鉴别诊断",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "LEFT (0)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": null,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "上呼吸道感染为临床高发的呼吸道疾病，细菌、病毒为主要致病病原体，二者所致感染症状相似但治疗方案截然不同，快速精准鉴别感染类型可指导临床合理用药、规避误诊误治风险及并发症，保障患者预后[1]。目前临床病原体培养是感染诊断的金标准，但检测周期长",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "1一般资料和方法",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "1.1一般资料",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "选取2024年5月-2025年8月我院收治的例上呼吸道感染患者为研究对象。患者年龄3-68岁，平均（35.12±4.26）岁；男例，女例；病程1-7d，平均（3.25±1.05）d。纳入标准：符合《内科学（第9版）》[3]中上呼吸道感染诊断",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "1.2方法",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "所有患者入院后采集外周静脉血2ml，分为两份样本进行检测。血常规指标检测：采用全自动血细胞分析仪（深圳市生物技术有限公司，粤械注准，型号）检测WBC、NEUT%、LYMPH%等核心血常规指标，严格按照仪器操作规程及试剂盒说明书完成检测，正常",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "1.3观察指标",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "（1）血常规指标及CRP水平：对比细菌性与病毒性上呼吸道感染患者的核心血常规指标（WBC、NEUT%、LYMPH%）及CRP水平差异。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "（2）鉴别诊断效能：分析血常规联合CRP检测的鉴别诊断准确率、灵敏度、特异度。准确率=（真阳性+真阴性）/总例数×100%；灵敏度=真阳性/（真阳性+假阴性）×100%；特异度=真阴性/（真阴性+假阳性）×100%。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "1.4统计学分析",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "以SPSS22.0软件处理数据，计量资料以（±s）表示，用t检验；计数资料以（%）表示，用χ2检验，P＜0.05为差异有统计学意义。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "2结果",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "2.1不同感染类型患者血常规及CRP指标对比",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "例患者中，细菌性上呼吸道感染例，病毒性上呼吸道感染例。细菌性上呼吸道感染患者WBC、NEUT%、CRP水平显著高于病毒性上呼吸道感染患者，LYMPH%显著低于病毒性上呼吸道感染患者，差异有统计学意义（P＜0.05）。见表1。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "LEFT (0)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "表1不同感染类型患者血常规及CRP指标对比（±s）",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "CENTER (1)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "2.2鉴别诊断效能",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "以病原学检测结果为金标准，血常规联合CRP检测的诊断准确率、灵敏度、特异度分别为9%（/）、95.%（/）、9%（/）。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "3讨论",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.335,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": null,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "上呼吸道感染是临床高发感染性疾病，病原体以细菌、病毒为主，两类感染的治疗原则截然不同，精准鉴别病原体类型是临床合理治疗的核心前提。病毒感染占上呼吸道感染无需应用抗生素治疗，盲目用药不仅无法改善病情，还会增加机体耐药性与不良反应风险；而细菌性",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": 0.0,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": 0.0,
      "space_after_pt": 0.0,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "本研究结果显示，细菌性上呼吸道感染患者WBC、NEUT%、CRP水平显著高于病毒性上呼吸道感染患者，LYMPH%显著低于病毒性上呼吸道感染患者，且联合检测的诊断准确率、灵敏度、特异度较高，证实联合检测可提升鉴别诊断精准度。究其因，血常规是临",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "JUSTIFY (3)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.292,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "综上所述，血常规指标与CRP在细菌性、病毒性上呼吸道感染中表达差异显著，二者联合检测可显著提升疾病鉴别诊断的准确率，诊断效能优异，能够为临床对症治疗、合理用药提供可靠的实验室支撑。",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "LEFT (0)",
      "left_indent_in": null,
      "first_line_indent_in": 0.333,
      "space_before_pt": null,
      "space_after_pt": null,
      "line_spacing": 1.5,
      "keep_with_next": false,
      "font": "宋体",
      "font_size_pt": 12.0,
      "bold": null
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "参考文献：",
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
